https://github.com/openbmc/dbus-sensors/commit/1b48571b93324692eefed001cbebae64ff7a955c

@spinler@us.ibm.com Would you be fine with disabling this check in EM?

Why do you have present here? This is not configuration but an runtime state. I would expect GPIO to be a composite structure of -

struct GPIO {
GPIOConfig
GPIOState
}

Where config is the one received from EM and the state is the one being manipulated locally. On the similar pattern classes would need to be organized to create that distinction and encapsulation hierarchy.

